{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102050","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1310205001:1":{"text":"스와프 씨, 또 만났네요!","source_cn":"斯瓦夫先生，又见到你啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74868EC52EF85D6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310205002:1":{"text":"정말 우연이네요! 이제 막 시더 마을에 왔는데 여러분과 또 만나게 되다니!","source_cn":"艾雅在上，是你们！真是巧了，我刚刚才进雪松镇，就又和你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8A051A9E0776589","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310205003:1":{"text":"그 대단한 하얀 늑대... 팔라모르는요?","source_cn":"那个很厉害的白狼……法拉莫尔呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x069887DF241D0681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310205004:1":{"text":"해야 할 일이 있어서 시더 마을에 오자마자 저희와 헤어졌어요.","source_cn":"他还有工作要做，刚来雪松镇就和我们分开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C847F350A7A0BAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310205005:1":{"text":"저는 그 세 식구를 마차에 태워 마을로 보냈어요. 식사할 겨를도 없었지만, 개막식을 놓치지 않아서 다행이에요.","source_cn":"我把那一家三口送上马车就往镇子里跑，饭也顾不上吃，还好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D6B889EBE117D9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310205006:1":{"text":"단지... 여러분에게 안내도 해드리고 구경시켜 드리기로 했었는데...","source_cn":"是了，说好了要给你们做向导，带你们逛逛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57FE3BC1FBEE7E37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1310205006":{"text":"단지... 여러분에게 안내도 해드리고 구경시켜 드리기로 했었는데...","source_cn":"是了，说好了要给你们做向导，带你们逛逛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57FE3BC1FBEE7E37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310205007:1":{"text":"맞아요, 고생을 많이 하셨으니 분명 지치셨을 거예요.","source_cn":"对呀，你看起来风尘仆仆的，一定累坏了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345031D70D27307B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310205008:1":{"text":"우선 식사부터 하고 푹 쉬세요.","source_cn":"先吃点东西好好休息一下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9327E1CDDA830E0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310205011:1":{"text":"아이고, 이런... 그렇게 말씀하시니 그럼 저도 더 이상 고집부리지 않겠습니다.","source_cn":"哎呀，这……你们这么说了，我也就不和你们争了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39E4266FC3C276FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310